   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Crowd/Greeting By Billy**: mythic rare: 2 archived performances [2]\n- ***#Up In Smoke**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **Pyramid Contry**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **Ol' Slew Foot**: back after 61 archived shows (407 days) [2]\n- **Beaumont Rag**: back after 62 archived shows (410 days) [2]\n- **#Rainy Day Women #12 & 35**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **The Old Mountaineer**: rare: 14 archived performances [2]\n- **Fiddling Around**: rare: 14 archived performances [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2024-04-20** (recommended): source not stated; 30 songs; 155 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Stage talk about: Billy [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2024-04-20**: taped by Z-Man; transferred by Z-Man; source: Schoeps CCM4V'S>Sound Devices Mix-Pre 6 II (48/32) [1]. Also: Recorded and seeded by Z-Man using Schoeps CCM4V microphones into a Sound Devices Mix-Pre 6 II at 48kHz/32-bit; Processed through Sound Forge 10.0 and CD Wave, then converted to 16-bit FLAC and tagged in Foobar 2000; labeled show 133 of 2024 [1]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings St. Augustine Amp N1 2024 Poster Regular - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/merch/st-augustine-amp-n1-2024-poster-regular/) [3]\n- Fan art by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings St. Augustine Amp N1 2024 Poster Regular - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/merch/st-augustine-amp-n1-2024-poster-regular/) [4]\n- Fan art by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings St. Augustine Amp N3 2024 Poster Regular - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/merch/st-augustine-amp-n3-2024-poster-regular/) [5]\n- Fan art by Brutifulstore.com: [Billy Strings April 2024 Tour The St Augustine Amphitheatre Event Wall Art Poster Canvas](https://brutifulstore.com/product/billy-strings-april-2024-tour-the-st-augustine-amphitheatre-event-wall-art-poster-canvas/) [6]\n- Fan art by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings St. Augustine Amp N2 2024 Poster Regular - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/merch/st-augustine-amp-n2-2024-poster-regular/) [7]\n- Poster by St Augustine Amphitheatre: [Billy Strings Tickets | 20 April 2024 | St. Augustine Amphitheatre](http://www.augustineamp.com/events/billy-strings-20-april-2024/) [8]",
